---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About DigiiState | National Digital Real Estate Brokerage">
	<main class="bg-white text-slate-900 min-h-screen">
		<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
			<header class="flex justify-between items-center mb-32">
				<a href="/" class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter flex items-center gap-2 group cursor-pointer">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-lg text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">D</div>
					<div class="flex flex-col leading-none">
						<span class="text-slate-950">Digii<span class="text-blue-600">State</span></span>
						<span class="text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-slate-400 font-bold">National Brokerage</span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<nav class="hidden lg:flex gap-12 text-[10px] uppercase font-black tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-400">
					<a href="/territories" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Portfolios</a>
					<a href="/#economics" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Alpha Logic</a>
					<a href="/about" class="text-blue-600">Brokerage</a>
				</nav>
				<a href="/#apply" class="bg-slate-950 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest transition-all shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/10 hover:bg-blue-600 active:scale-95">
					Secure Territory
				</a>
			</header>

			<div class="max-w-4xl">
				<h1 class="text-6xl md:text-[80px] font-[900] mb-12 leading-[0.85] tracking-[-0.05em] uppercase text-slate-950">
					THE FUTURE OF <br/>
					<span class="text-blue-600">LOCAL DOMINANCE.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-slate-500 text-2xl leading-relaxed mb-16 font-light">
					DigiiState is not a marketing agency. We are a technical land-grab operation. We identify high-intent local search gaps, deploy institutional-grade digital assets, and lease them to the dominant service providers in each region.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-20 py-20 border-t border-slate-100">
				<div class="space-y-8">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-950">Our Asset Strategy</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
						We focus on "Abundant Clarity" SEO. While other sites clutter their pages with irrelevant design, we focus on technical velocity and keyword density. Our assets are engineered to rank on Page One of Google and stay there.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="space-y-8">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-950">The Monopoly Model</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
						By partnering with only one provider per territory, we remove the "race to the bottom" bidding wars typical of Google Ads and shared lead platforms. We give you the exclusive digital deed to your city.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
